Modified when vendored, by scripts/vendor-skill.mjs. The changes are mechanical
and do not alter the meaning:

  - YAML frontmatter removed. It configures a skill runner.
  - Relative links rewritten to addresses on github.com, because the reader is
    an AI inside an n8n workflow and cannot open a file on disk.
  - Three files left out, being the command-line tool's manual rather than
    guidance on writing an edit: SKILL.md, references/ingest.md and
    references/onboarding.md.
  - A short note prepended, marked as ours, explaining the reader's situation.

The exact source commit also travels with the data, as SKILL_SOURCE, so it can
be read at runtime rather than only found here.

